          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": "5"
        },
        "reviewBody": "This was a very cool take on regular meatballs with bread crumbs, which is not keto friendly.  We loved the sun dried tomatoes and red onion in the meatballs, and they stayed so moist!  The broccoli was a great side dish.  I did separate the chicken meatballs on their own tray, and put the broccoli on \nit's own tray as my oven took a bit longer to cook the meatball vs the broccoli.  Will definitely make again!",
